      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b56b5ab3863dc75b06a863f|full_name}: I don't think any of the methods malicious users have employed to steal avatars are related to future-proofing.\nI'm not entirely certain of this, but it seems like future-proofing may have been made somewhat redundant as a result of Unity's assistance when VRChat upgraded to 2017.4.15f1.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
